&lt;p&gt;FlySto is a startup project with a small, distributed team. We have a server, web client, and Android and iOS apps – all written in Kotlin and supported by JetBrains.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modern aircraft, even small ones, are equipped with sophisticated avionics systems that measure various flight and engine parameters and record them to internal storage or memory cards. The resulting log files contain enough data to literally “replay” an entire flight, displaying the aircraft’s precise position and orientation, along with all instrument readings available to the pilots. Our product allows pilots to store and analyze their flights from different perspectives on the web and mobile devices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently looking for a Lead Product Designer to join our team!&lt;/p&gt;
